stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE: request sent to llm-server

    ACTIVE --> CONNECTION_ERROR: HTTP error / timeout
    CONNECTION_ERROR --> RETRY_SCHEDULE: emit("error")

    RETRY_SCHEDULE --> INCREMENT: retryCount++
    INCREMENT --> CHECK_MAX: > 5 retries ?

    CHECK_MAX --> ABORT: yes → requests rejected
    CHECK_MAX --> BACKOFF: delay = restartDelay (1s)

    BACKOFF --> DOUBLE: restartDelay = min(delay×2, 30s)
    DOUBLE --> WAIT: setTimeout(delay)
    WAIT --> RETRY: new fetch()
    RETRY --> ACTIVE: success
    RETRY --> CONNECTION_ERROR: fail

    note right of BACKOFF: 1s → 2s → 4s → 8s → 16s<br/>(max 30s, max 5 attempts)<br/>llm-server is PM2-managed
